# Capture whole-book

When the user asks for whole-book opportunity capture, buy-in-red refinement,
or deterministic momentum/recovery path evidence:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/capture-book/SKILL.md`.
2. Run `python src/run_operator_suites.py capture` (default 90-day existing data).
3. Produce a capture canvas with one Ledger and concise best-moves section.
4. Keep output deterministic (no 0-100 composite, no ad-hoc SQL scripts).
5. Include an optional open section for wider `01_04_2026` backtest coverage.
6. To score how those job tags would have done, run `python src/run_operator_suites.py capture-replay` on the dump (PIT vs later closes). Any matching window: `--af-start` / `--af-end --rebuild`. Do not invent a 0-100; quote sleeve mean / ras / hit_rate.
